===About===
Returning for another action-packed season, Get2Gether aims to offer a good competition that boosts activity, proving grounds for the interested, as well as an opportunity to get together with old or new teammates. 

With liberal rules (like, any map can be played if both agree), we hope to see some good and fun games!
==Format==
* '''Group phase''' (BO3)
** Round robin groups of 4, all teams play eachother.
** <span style="background-color:{{Color|up}};">Top 2</span> in each group goes into [https://wiki.quakeworld.nu/wiki/Get2GetherSE/Div1#Division_1_Gold_Bracket Gold Bracket].
** <span style="background-color:{{Color|stay}};">Bottom 2</span> in each group goes into [https://wiki.quakeworld.nu/wiki/Get2GetherSE/Div1#Division_1_Silver_Bracket Silver Bracket].
** Teams on equal points will be separated by: 1) direct confrontation, 2) most frags.

* '''Bracket phase''' (BO5) 
** Single elemination bracket.
** Third place deciders will be played.

==Signups==
Signups are [https://www.quakeworld.nu/forum/topic/7312/108300/get2gether-second-edition-sign-up#108300 closed], since 13 January 2019. In total, '''32 teams''' and '''76 players''' registered.
